HKG":"香港是轉口港，BACI 不計香港的轉口（2024 年香港的平板顯示模組出口只有 78.8 億美元），經香港轉往中國大陸等地的貨都記在香港的進口","CHN":"經香港轉進來的貨記在香港的進口；2024 年中國大陸加香港是 545 億美元"},"notesEn":{"TWN":"BACI has no reports from Taiwan itself (the UN does not publish Taiwan's trade statistics): Taiwan's imports are what exporting countries recorded as shipped to Taiwan, and goods sent via Hong Kong or other hubs are often recorded as going to the hub (BACI also leaves out Hong Kong's re-exports). Taiwan's Ministry of Finance customs statistics (by origin) show flat panel display module imports of US$913 million in 2024 (10% more than BACI)","HKG":"Hong Kong is an entrepôt, and BACI leaves out its re-exports (Hong Kong's flat panel display module exports in 2024 were only US$7.9 billion), so goods passing through Hong Kong to mainland China and elsewhere are counted as Hong Kong's imports","CHN":"Goods arriving via Hong Kong are counted as Hong Kong's imports; mainland China and Hong Kong together imported US$54.5 billion in 2024"}}